<para>Encode Passage Batch.</para>
<para>Processes passages in batches for improved throughput on GPU. Target: ≥ 100 docs/sec for batch_size=32.</para>
<para>An empty <computeroutput>passages</computeroutput> input is valid and returns an empty vector immediately without any I/O or ONNX calls.</para>
