    <briefdescription>
<para>Dense Passage Retrieval (DPR) bi-encoder vectorizer. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implements the DPR approach: separate query and passage encoders that produce fixed-size embeddings. Used in <ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_hybrid_retriever" kindref="compound">HybridRetriever</ref> for dense retrieval alongside BM25 sparse retrieval.</para>
<para>Thread Safety: A single <ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_d_p_r_vectorizer" kindref="compound">DPRVectorizer</ref> instance is NOT thread-safe. Create one instance per thread or protect concurrent calls with a mutex. Batch operations (<ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_d_p_r_vectorizer_1ad757732b72b1268a558d46feecbb2e47" kindref="member">encodePassageBatch</ref>) are optimized for GPU utilization. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
